{
  "_comment": "Curated, portable Arctic Fuse 3 skin settings that define the ThoughtStream look, lifted from the attached build. The setup service applies these on every start (bools via Skin.SetBool / Skin.Reset, strings via Skin.SetString) so the look self-heals and ports cleanly to any device. Deliberately excluded: generator hashes and checksums, the rebuild timestamp, any hardcoded local file paths, background.image (handled by the background copy step), and the HomeSwitcher slot Name/toggle/mode settings (handled by the menu deploy from slots.json). defaultconfig.initdone and home.firstrun are set true so a fresh device does not run the AF3 first-run wizard and clobber this layout.",
